      Exact 8x8 Pixel Art Leaf (LEAF_WELLNESS) centered in the 66dp safe zone:
      Origin at (30, 30), each pixel block is 6x6 units (8 * 6 = 48x48):
      Row 0: ....1111 -> cols 4,5,6,7
      Row 1: ..111221 -> cols 2,3,4 (1), cols 5,6 (2), col 7 (1)
      Row 2: .1122111 -> cols 1,2 (1), cols 3,4 (2), cols 5,6,7 (1)
      Row 3: .121111. -> col 1 (1), col 2 (2), cols 3,4,5,6 (1)
      Row 4: .11111.. -> cols 1,2,3,4,5 (1)
      Row 5: ..111... -> cols 2,3,4 (1)
      Row 6: .11..... -> cols 1,2 (1)
      Row 7: 1....... -> col 0 (1)
    -->

